204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 124 0 R
/T (The opportunity is students face issues with booking a lot of travel plans, so it unlocks value for both the user and travel industry by solving this problem. This is because a lot of the people who decide to have cheaper travel, especially students, budget travelers or even single travelers. This causes an issue to where them really being able to plan things, then also lessening their chances to travel because of the lack of transparency. So when we create an online budget-focused app, we basically allow them to not spend too much time on planning and help to also build a lot of customer loyalty, and make travel far more accessible.)
/E (The opportunity is students face issues with booking a lot of travel plans, so it unlocks value for both the user and travel industry by solving this problem. This is because a lot of the people who decide to have cheaper travel, especially students, budget travelers or even single travelers. This causes an issue to where them really being able to plan things, then also lessening their chances to travel because of the lack of transparency. So when we create an online budget-focused app, we basically allow them to not spend too much time on planning and help to also build a lot of customer loyalty, and make travel far more accessible.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
